      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In the face of rapid, widespread job displacement, the reactive nature of traditional welfare systems presents a significant scaling risk. UBI provides the necessary pre-emptive economic insulation against mass structural unemployment. While the financing challenges are immense, its proactive capability addresses the fundamental threat to mass consumer stability posed by an automated economy. It shifts the focus from patching small holes to underpinning the entire economic structure.",
      "source": "target",
